#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:1
msgid "Site UI Modules"
msgstr "Site UI 模块"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for frontend developers building a distribution's own public"
" pages. If configuration and branding are enough for you, see "
"[Distribution customization](distribution-customization.md) instead."
msgstr ""
"本页面向为发行版开发自有公开页面的前端开发者。如果配置和品牌设置已经够用，请改看[发行版定制](distribution-"
"customization.md)。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:7
msgid ""
"A deployment can replace the public pages a visitor sees — the landing "
"page, the frame around the account pages, the legal page — without "
"forking the console. It does so with a **build-time UI module**: a small "
"tree of React components that the frontend image compiles in, alongside "
"the shared application rather than instead of it."
msgstr ""
"部署可以替换访客看到的公开页面（落地页、账号页面的外壳、法律条款页），而无需 fork 控制台。做法是使用一个**构建时 UI 模块**：一小棵 "
"React 组件树，由前端镜像编译进去，与共享应用并存，而不是取代它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:13
msgid ""
"One Next.js application, one console, one session. A distribution ships a"
" small UI module; the build compiles it in."
msgstr "一个 Next.js 应用、一个控制台、一套会话。发行版提供一个小型 UI 模块，由构建过程编译进应用。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:23
msgid ""
"Here `C` is the upstream source commit and `U` is the distribution's UI "
"source commit. Pin both when building a release. The module is not "
"fetched or swapped at runtime; component, stylesheet and compiled-copy "
"changes require a new frontend image. Runtime branding read by the module"
" retains its runtime behavior."
msgstr ""
"这里的 `C` 是上游源码提交，`U` 是发行版的 UI "
"源码提交。构建发布版本时需同时锁定两者。模块不会在运行时获取或替换；组件、样式表和编译进镜像的文案变更需要新的前端镜像。模块读取的运行时品牌配置仍按运行时配置的方式生效。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:28
msgid "What a module can and cannot change"
msgstr "模块可以修改什么"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The module owns"
msgstr "模块负责"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The shared application keeps"
msgstr "共享应用保留"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the home page, if it exports one"
msgstr "模块导出的首页"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"dashboard, chat, admin, team and authorize pages, and the `/agents` proxy"
" integration"
msgstr "仪表盘、chat、admin、team 和 authorize 页面，以及 `/agents` 代理集成"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the frame around the account pages, and where each field's parts go"
msgstr "账号页面外壳，以及每个字段各部分的位置"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the account forms, their fields, validation and submit calls"
msgstr "账号表单、字段、验证与提交请求"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the legal text and the sign-up confirmations, if it ships its own"
msgstr "模块自带的法律文本和注册确认项"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"the consent step, the one `accepted_tos` flag sign-up records, and the "
"terms anchors the account pages link to"
msgstr "注册同意步骤、注册时记录的唯一 `accepted_tos` 标志，以及账号页面引用的条款锚点"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "its own wording for the account pages"
msgstr "账号页面的自有文案"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the schemas, error codes, session handling and redirect rules"
msgstr "数据结构、错误码、会话处理与重定向规则"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the public pages' titles, and the language of the pages it renders"
msgstr "公开页面的标题，以及模块所渲染页面的语言"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "every console page's title and language"
msgstr "所有控制台页面的标题和语言"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "its own stylesheet and design assets"
msgstr "自有样式表与设计资源"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the runtime branding document and `/site-config`"
msgstr "运行时品牌文档与 `/site-config`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:39
msgid ""
"A module cannot change who gets in: the account pages' business logic, "
"the registration gate, the email-verification requirement and the "
"permission rules are all in the shared application and are not part of "
"this interface."
msgstr "模块不能改变访问资格：账号页面的业务逻辑、注册开关、邮箱验证要求和权限规则都属于共享应用，不在此接口范围内。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:43
msgid ""
"The shared application also keeps the session store, proxy rules, and "
"`AuthField` / `AuthNotice` / `AuthLoading` accessibility behavior. A "
"module cannot register a route or take over an unlisted page. A new path "
"such as `/pricing`, a console redesign or a new authentication method "
"needs an application change beyond this interface."
msgstr ""
"共享应用还保留会话存储、代理规则，以及 `AuthField` / `AuthNotice` / `AuthLoading` "
"的无障碍行为。模块不能注册路由或接管未列出的页面。新增 `/pricing` "
"等路径、重新设计控制台或增加认证方式，都需要在此接口范围之外修改应用。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:49
msgid ""
"The host facade exposes public site configuration, resolved branding, "
"session state and the supported presentation types/helpers. Session state"
" lets a page choose a sign-in or console link; the facade does not expose"
" login/logout, tokens or authentication operations. The normative "
"TypeScript interfaces live in `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/contract.ts`, "
"and the supported imports in `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/host.ts`."
msgstr ""
"宿主接口公开站点配置、解析后的品牌配置、会话状态及受支持的展示类型／辅助函数。页面可以根据会话状态选择展示登录链接或控制台链接；该接口不公开登录／退出、令牌或认证操作。规范性的"
" TypeScript 接口位于 `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/contract.ts`，受支持的导入位于 "
"`apps/frontend/src/site-ui/host.ts`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:56
msgid "What a module may import"
msgstr "模块可以导入什么"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:58
msgid ""
"A module may import `@site-ui/host`, `react`, `react/*`, `react-dom`, "
"`next`, `next/*` and its own files. Relative imports must stay inside the"
" module. Anything else — in particular `@/...` — fails the build."
msgstr ""
"模块可以导入 `@site-ui/host`、`react`、`react/*`、`react-dom`、`next`、`next/*` "
"及自身文件。相对导入必须限定在模块内部。其他导入，尤其是 `@/...`，会使构建失败。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:62
msgid ""
"The build holds a module to that list where webpack resolves each of its "
"requests, in every compilation Next.js runs, and judges a request by the "
"real path it resolves to rather than by how it is spelled. These fail as "
"well:"
msgstr ""
"构建在 webpack 解析模块每个请求的环节执行这份清单，覆盖 Next.js "
"运行的每一次编译；判断请求时依据它最终解析到的真实路径，而不是它的写法。以下情况同样会使构建失败："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:66
msgid "a relative path or a symlink that leads out of the module;"
msgstr "指向模块之外的相对路径或符号链接；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:67
msgid ""
"a framework subpath that walks back out, such as `next/../../src/site-"
"ui/routes`;"
msgstr "借助上级目录跳出框架包的子路径，例如 `next/../../src/site-ui/routes`；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:68
msgid "a stylesheet `@import` or `url()` that leaves the module;"
msgstr "指向模块之外的样式表 `@import` 或 `url()`；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:69
msgid ""
"a computed import — `require.context`, `import.meta.webpackContext` or an"
" `import()` of a template literal — over a directory outside the module;"
msgstr ""
"作用于模块外目录的计算式导入，包括 `require.context`、`import.meta.webpackContext` "
"或以模板字符串调用的 `import()`；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:71
msgid "a `data:` or `file:` URI, or a Node.js built-in;"
msgstr "`data:` 或 `file:` URI，以及 Node.js 内置模块；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:72
msgid ""
"an inline loader other than Next.js's own, such as `!!raw-"
"loader!./notes.txt`;"
msgstr "Next.js 自带 loader 以外的内联 loader，例如 `!!raw-loader!./notes.txt`；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:73
msgid ""
"anything in a `node_modules` directory inside the module. A module's "
"dependencies come from the application's lockfile, and staging does not "
"copy that directory."
msgstr "模块内部 `node_modules` 目录中的任何内容。模块的依赖来自应用的锁文件，暂存步骤也不会复制该目录。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:77
msgid ""
"The build also admits the helpers Next.js's compiler adds to a module's "
"code, `@swc/helpers` and `styled-jsx`, resolved from Next.js itself. A "
"module does not import them by name."
msgstr ""
"构建还允许 Next.js 编译器注入到模块代码中的辅助库 `@swc/helpers` 和 `styled-jsx`，它们从 Next.js "
"自身解析。模块不会按名称导入它们。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:81
msgid ""
"A source check reports what it can see earlier: when a module is staged, "
"and before every build, type check and test run. It parses scripts with "
"the TypeScript parser, reads stylesheets, and lists every problem at "
"once. Files under `test/`, `tests/`, `__tests__/` or `__mocks__/`, and "
"`vitest`, `jest` or `playwright` configuration files, are exempt unless "
"production code imports them; a test helper that `client.tsx` imports is "
"checked like any other file. Every symlink the staging step would copy "
"must resolve inside the module."
msgstr ""
"源码检查会更早报告它能发现的问题：在暂存模块时，以及每次构建、类型检查和测试运行之前。它用 TypeScript "
"解析器解析脚本，读取样式表，并一次列出所有问题。`test/`、`tests/`、`__tests__/` 或 `__mocks__/` "
"下的文件，以及 `vitest`、`jest` 或 `playwright` 配置文件，只要生产代码没有导入它们，就不受检查；被 "
"`client.tsx` 导入的测试辅助文件会像其他文件一样接受检查。暂存步骤会复制的每个符号链接都必须解析到模块内部。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:89
msgid "A module is a directory"
msgstr "模块是一个目录"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:101
msgid ""
"The host loads `styles.css`: the root layout imports it through the "
"generated bridge on every page, after the application's own stylesheet, "
"so a module rule wins over an application rule of the same specificity. A"
" module does not import it."
msgstr ""
"`styles.css` "
"由宿主加载：根布局在每个页面上通过生成的桥接文件导入它，并排在应用自身样式表之后，因此优先级相同时，模块规则会覆盖应用规则。模块不必自行导入它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`server.ts` must exist, and may contain only `export {};`. Its two "
"exports, `locale` and `metaMessages`, are optional; see [Document "
"language and page titles](#document-language-and-page-titles)."
msgstr ""
"`server.ts` 必须存在，可以仅包含 `export {};`。它的两个导出 `locale` 和 `metaMessages` "
"都是可选的；参见[文档语言与页面标题](#document-language-and-page-titles)。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:110
msgid "`client.tsx` exports:"
msgstr "`client.tsx` 的导出项："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出项"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必填"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`descriptor`"
msgstr "`descriptor`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A named literal `{ siteUiApi, id, locale }`; all three values must match "
"`site_ui_api`, `id` and `locale` in the manifest."
msgstr ""
"具名的对象字面量 `{ siteUiApi, id, locale }`；这三个值必须与 manifest 中的 "
"`site_ui_api`、`id` 和 `locale` 分别一致。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`Landing`"
msgstr "`Landing`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Rendered at `/`. Supplying one replaces the console's home page."
msgstr "在 `/` 渲染。提供它会替换控制台首页。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`AuthFrame`"
msgstr "`AuthFrame`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"The frame around `/login`, `/signup`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-"
"password`, `/verify-email`."
msgstr ""
"`/login`、`/signup`、`/forgot-password`、`/reset-password`、`/verify-email` "
"的外壳。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`fieldLayout`"
msgstr "`fieldLayout`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Where each account field's label, control, hint, error and action go."
msgstr "每个账号字段的标签、控件、提示、错误和操作放在哪里。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`TermsFrame`"
msgstr "`TermsFrame`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "all three or none"
msgstr "三者全部提供或都不提供"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The page around the module's legal text at `/terms`."
msgstr "`/terms` 上包裹模块法律文本的页面外壳。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`TermsContent`"
msgstr "`TermsContent`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The module's legal text, at `/terms` and in the sign-up consent step."
msgstr "模块的法律文本，用于 `/terms` 和注册同意步骤。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`consentItems`"
msgstr "`consentItems`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What the sign-up consent step asks a visitor to confirm: a non-empty list"
" of `{ id, label, description? }`."
msgstr "注册同意步骤要求访客确认的内容：一个非空的 `{ id, label, description? }` 列表。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`authAppearance`"
msgstr "`authAppearance`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"Deprecated class-map compatibility for the shared forms, supported "
"throughout API v1."
msgstr "共享表单的类名映射兼容接口，已弃用，但在 API v1 生命周期内持续受支持。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`authMessages`"
msgstr "`authMessages`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The deployment's wording for the account pages."
msgstr "部署的账号页面文案。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:124
msgid ""
"The host reads named exports only. A client entry with a default export "
"fails the build, and so does a second file for the same entry — "
"`client.tsx` beside `client.js`, say — because the bundler, the type "
"checker and the test runner complete the name in different orders. The "
"server entry may keep a default export; the host does not read it."
msgstr ""
"宿主只读取具名导出。客户端入口带有默认导出会使构建失败；同一入口存在第二个文件（例如 `client.tsx` 旁边还有 "
"`client.js`）也会失败，因为打包器、类型检查器和测试工具补全文件扩展名的顺序各不相同。服务端入口可以保留默认导出，宿主不会读取它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:130
msgid ""
"`npm run type-check` and `next build` check the exports against the "
"contract in `contract.ts`: `client.tsx` against `SiteUiClientModule`, "
"`server.ts` against `SiteUiServerModule`. An export of the wrong type "
"fails, naming the export, and so do a partial legal set and an empty "
"`consentItems`. As the module loads, the host checks again for what a "
"cast or an `any` hides from the compiler: a component export that is not "
"a component, a partial legal set, and `consentItems` that is empty, "
"repeats an id, or has an item without an id or a label. Any of them stops"
" the module from loading."
msgstr ""
"`npm run type-check` 和 `next build` 会按照 `contract.ts` "
"中的契约检查导出：`client.tsx` 对照 `SiteUiClientModule`，`server.ts` 对照 "
"`SiteUiServerModule`。类型错误的导出会导致检查失败，错误信息会指明该导出；不完整的法律条款组和空的 "
"`consentItems` 同样会失败。模块加载时，宿主会再次检查类型断言或 `any` "
"对编译器隐藏的问题：不是组件的组件导出、不完整的法律条款组，以及为空、id 重复或有条目缺少 id 或 label 的 "
"`consentItems`。其中任何一项都会使模块无法加载。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:139
msgid ""
"**`next build` does not load the module.** Every page renders on demand, "
"so the build evaluates no client module. A mistake only the load-time "
"check can see builds cleanly and fails on the first request; from then on"
" every page answers HTTP 500. Smoke-test each image before releasing it: "
"start it with its gateway and request `/`, the five account pages and "
"`/terms`."
msgstr ""
"**`next build` 不会加载模块。** "
"每个页面都按需渲染，因此构建过程不会执行任何客户端模块。只有加载时检查才能发现的错误可以顺利通过构建，却会在第一次请求时失败；此后每个页面都返回 "
"HTTP 500。发布每个镜像前都要做冒烟测试：连同网关一起启动它，并请求 `/`、五个账号页面和 `/terms`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:145
msgid ""
"**Leaving out an optional export is a choice, not a gap.** `Landing: "
"null` means \"use the console's home page here\"; omitting `AuthFrame` "
"means \"put the account pages inside the console's container\". A module "
"that exports neither replaces nothing, which is fine while you are still "
"writing it."
msgstr ""
"**省略可选导出是一种选择，而不是缺漏**。`Landing: null` 表示「这里使用控制台的首页」；省略 `AuthFrame` "
"表示「把账号页面放进控制台的容器里」。两者都不导出的模块什么也不替换，在你还在编写它的时候，这完全没问题。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:150
msgid ""
"**A frame draws the whole page.** `AuthFrame` and `TermsFrame` render "
"their own header, `<main>` and footer. A frame that draws only a card "
"leaves the five account pages without a header or footer, and the host "
"cannot add them back, so get this right first."
msgstr ""
"**外壳负责绘制整个页面**。`AuthFrame` 和 `TermsFrame` 自己渲染页头、`<main>` "
"和页脚。只画出一张卡片的外壳，会让五个账号页面都没有页头和页脚，宿主也无法把它们补回来，所以要先把这一点做对。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:155
msgid ""
"`AuthFrame` must render the supplied shared form `children` and preserve "
"any provided `topbar` and `legal` nodes. Its headings and page identifier"
" let one frame serve the five account routes. It supplies the complete "
"outer page, so the host does not add another header or footer around it."
msgstr ""
"`AuthFrame` 必须渲染提供的共享表单 `children`，并保留任何传入的 `topbar` 和 `legal` "
"节点。标题和页面标识让同一个外壳能够服务五个账号路由。它负责完整的外层页面，因此宿主不会再在它外面添加页头或页脚。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:160
msgid ""
"**The legal set is one decision.** A module that publishes its own terms "
"exports `TermsFrame`, `TermsContent` and `consentItems` together; one "
"that exports none of them keeps the console's terms and its four "
"confirmations. The host renders `TermsContent` in both places a visitor "
"meets the terms: at `/terms`, as the `children` of `TermsFrame`, and in "
"the sign-up consent step, where the module's `consentItems` replace the "
"console's confirmations. The text a visitor accepts is the text the site "
"publishes."
msgstr ""
"**法律条款组是一个整体决定。** 发布自有条款的模块要同时导出 `TermsFrame`、`TermsContent` 和 "
"`consentItems`；三者都不导出的模块沿用控制台的条款及其四个确认项。宿主会在访客看到条款的两个地方渲染 "
"`TermsContent`：在 `/terms` 上作为 `TermsFrame` 的 `children`；在注册同意步骤中，由模块的 "
"`consentItems` 替换控制台的确认项。访客接受的文本就是站点发布的文本。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:168
msgid ""
"`TermsContent` renders the legal body only — its sections and any "
"preamble such as a date; the page heading is the frame's. It receives "
"`headingLevel` 2 and `compact` false at `/terms`, and `headingLevel` 3 "
"and `compact` true in the consent step's scrolling box. `TermsFrame` "
"draws the page around it and must render its `children`. At `/terms`, "
"give each section its `terms-s` anchor: the account pages link privacy to"
" `/terms#terms-s5`. Setting manifest file paths does not substitute a "
"legal document here."
msgstr ""
"`TermsContent` 只渲染法律正文，即各章节以及日期之类的前言；页面标题由外壳负责。在 `/terms` 上，它收到的 "
"`headingLevel` 为 2、`compact` 为 false；在注册同意步骤的滚动框中，`headingLevel` 为 "
"3、`compact` 为 true。`TermsFrame` 负责绘制包裹它的页面，并且必须渲染其 `children`。在 `/terms` "
"上，请为每个章节设置 `terms-s` 锚点：账号页面的隐私链接指向 `/terms#terms-s5`。设置 manifest "
"中的文件路径不能替代这里的法律文档。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:176
msgid ""
"Declare `consentItems` with the `ConsentItems` type, and give each item a"
" unique `id`. A plain `ConsentItem[]` fails the type check, because it "
"does not promise at least one item. Every item unlocks once the visitor "
"has read the terms to the end, and Continue waits for all of them. The "
"backend records a single `accepted_tos` flag, which the sign-up request "
"sends only after every item has been checked."
msgstr ""
"请用 `ConsentItems` 类型声明 `consentItems`，并为每个条目设置唯一的 `id`。普通的 "
"`ConsentItem[]` 无法通过类型检查，因为它不能保证至少有一个条目。访客把条款读到末尾后，每个条目才会解锁；Continue "
"按钮要等所有条目都勾选后才可用。后端只记录一个 `accepted_tos` 标志，注册请求只有在每个条目都勾选之后才会发送它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:183
msgid ""
"`authMessages` changes wording, not validation or the required field set."
" The host keeps only the keys `AUTH_MESSAGE_KEYS` declares, with string "
"values, and drops everything else before a page reads it, so wording for "
"a console page — `auth.authorize.*` for `/authorize`, `chat.*` for "
"`/chat` — has no effect. Missing keys retain the shared defaults. "
"Preserve each message's interpolation variables. A module may localize "
"its own pages and supported keys, but this does not translate every "
"console page."
msgstr ""
"`authMessages` 修改文案，不改变校验规则或必填字段集合。宿主只保留 `AUTH_MESSAGE_KEYS` "
"声明的键及其字符串值，并在页面读取之前丢弃其余内容，因此针对控制台页面的文案（`/authorize` 的 "
"`auth.authorize.*`、`/chat` 的 "
"`chat.*`）不会生效。缺失的键继续使用共享默认值。请保留每条消息的插值变量。模块可以本地化自己的页面和受支持的消息键，但这不会翻译所有控制台页面。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:191
msgid "Document language and page titles"
msgstr "文档语言与页面标题"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:193
msgid ""
"The server entry's optional `locale` sets `<html lang>` on the routes the"
" module renders: `/` when it exports `Landing`, the five account pages "
"when it exports `AuthFrame`, and `/terms` when it exports the legal set. "
"Every other route — the console, and a public route whose export the "
"module leaves out — is the console's, in `en`. An empty or omitted "
"`locale` keeps `en` everywhere. The attribute follows client-side "
"navigation as well as the first response."
msgstr ""
"服务端入口中可选的 `locale` 设置模块所渲染路由的 `<html lang>`：导出 `Landing` 时为 `/`，导出 "
"`AuthFrame` 时为五个账号页面，导出法律条款组时为 "
"`/terms`。其余路由（控制台，以及模块未提供相应导出的公开路由）都属于控制台，使用 `en`。`locale` 为空或省略时，所有路由都保持"
" `en`。该属性既体现在首次响应中，也会随客户端导航更新。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:200
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The optional `metaMessages` words the titles and descriptions of the "
"seven public routes. Its keys are `meta.<page>.title` and "
"`meta.<page>.description`, where `<page>` is `home`, `login`, `signup`, "
"`forgot`, `reset`, `verify` or `terms`; `META_MESSAGE_KEYS` in "
"`contract.ts` lists them. The host filters it the way it filters "
"`authMessages`, dropping undeclared keys and values that are not strings."
" `meta.home.title` is the whole document title; every other title is "
"shown as `<title> | <site name>`, as on the console's own pages. Each "
"value may use `{app_name}`."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `metaMessages` 为七个公开路由提供标题和描述文案。它的键是 `meta.<page>.title` 和 "
"`meta.<page>.description`，其中 `<page>` 为 "
"`home`、`login`、`signup`、`forgot`、`reset`、`verify` 或 `terms`；`contract.ts`"
" 中的 `META_MESSAGE_KEYS` 列出了全部键。宿主会像过滤 `authMessages` "
"一样过滤它，丢弃未声明的键和非字符串值。`meta.home.title` 是完整的文档标题；其他标题显示为 `<title> | <site "
"name>`，与控制台自身页面一致。每个值都可以使用 `{app_name}`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:209
msgid ""
"A page the module does not word keeps its default: the site's title and "
"description, or \"Terms of Service\" for `/terms`. Titles do not depend "
"on which routes the module renders. Console pages keep their English "
"titles, and icons come from runtime branding."
msgstr ""
"模块未提供文案的页面保留默认值：站点自身的标题和描述，`/terms` 则为“Terms of "
"Service”。标题与模块渲染哪些路由无关。控制台页面保留英文标题，图标来自运行时品牌配置。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:214
msgid "Building an image with a module"
msgstr "使用模块构建镜像"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:216
msgid ""
"The official frontend Dockerfile takes the module as a Buildx named "
"context:"
msgstr "官方前端 Dockerfile 通过 Buildx 命名上下文接收模块："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`site-ui` context"
msgstr "`site-ui` 上下文"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the built-in marker"
msgstr "内置标记"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "no external module; the neutral UI"
msgstr "没有外部模块，使用默认 UI"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`.`"
msgstr "`.`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the module's directory inside the context"
msgstr "上下文中的模块目录"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`SITE_UI_API`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_API`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "required with an external module; must be `1`"
msgstr "使用外部模块时必填，必须为 `1`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:242
msgid ""
"A distribution may pass its whole `frontend/` tree as the context and "
"select the module with `SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui`. This keeps the module "
"and its related build inputs under one pinned source tree."
msgstr ""
"发行版可以将整个 `frontend/` 树作为上下文，并通过 `SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui` "
"选择模块。这样，模块及其相关构建输入都包含在同一个固定版本的源码树中。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:246
msgid ""
"An external context that carries no module **fails the build**. Falling "
"back to the neutral UI would publish a site whose home page reverted, and"
" nothing in the build log would say so."
msgstr "外部上下文未包含模块时，**构建会失败**。不能悄悄回退到默认 UI，否则发布的首页会变回控制台页面，构建日志却毫无提示。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:250
msgid ""
"The reverse fails too. `SITE_UI_API`, or a `SITE_UI_SUBDIR` other than "
"`.`, given without `--build-context site-ui=...` stops the build with a "
"message that names the missing context, rather than building the neutral "
"UI in the module's place."
msgstr ""
"反过来也会失败：没有提供 `--build-context site-ui=...`，却设置了 `SITE_UI_API` 或不等于 `.` 的 "
"`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`，构建会停止并报错指出缺少的上下文，而不是用默认 UI 顶替模块。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:255
msgid "Local development"
msgstr "本地开发"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:257
msgid ""
"The same staging step runs on a workstation, without Docker. Run a "
"gateway first and set `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` to its address if it is not "
"`http://backend:8080`; the existing runtime `/site-config` dependency is "
"unchanged:"
msgstr ""
"同一暂存步骤也可在工作站运行，无需 Docker。请先启动网关；若地址不是 `http://backend:8080`，则设置 "
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`。应用对运行时 `/site-config` 的依赖保持不变："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:271
msgid ""
"Staging empties `--into` before it copies the module in, so `--into` must"
" be a directory of its own: it may not overlap `--context`, and may not "
"be or contain `--app`."
msgstr ""
"暂存步骤会先清空 `--into` 再复制模块，因此 `--into` 必须是一个独立目录：不能与 `--context` 重叠，也不能等于或包含"
" `--app`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:275
msgid ""
"`SITE_UI_DIR` and `SITE_UI_API` name the module directly if you would "
"rather not stage a copy:"
msgstr "如果不想暂存副本，可以用 `SITE_UI_DIR` 和 `SITE_UI_API` 直接指定模块："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:283
msgid ""
"A relative `SITE_UI_DIR` resolves against `apps/frontend`, whichever "
"directory the command runs from. Tailwind scans the selected module's "
"directory as well as `src/`, so a utility class that only a module "
"outside `src/` uses is still generated."
msgstr ""
"相对路径形式的 `SITE_UI_DIR` 总是相对于 `apps/frontend` 解析，与命令在哪个目录运行无关。Tailwind 除了扫描"
" `src/`，还会扫描所选模块的目录，因此只被 `src/` 之外的模块使用的工具类也会生成。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:288
msgid ""
"The variables above apply to that one command; no shell profile is "
"changed. To return to the neutral UI, stop the server and run:"
msgstr "上述变量仅作用于当前命令，不会修改 shell 配置。若要恢复默认 UI，停止服务器后执行："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:295
msgid ""
"Local dev serves module assets via `SITE_ASSETS_DIR`; the image recipe "
"packages them automatically."
msgstr "本地开发通过 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 提供模块资源；镜像配方会自动打包这些资源。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:298
msgid ""
"The staging environment file is used by the Dockerfile, not automatically"
" read by npm. Leaving a staged directory behind does not select it for "
"later commands."
msgstr "暂存环境文件由 Dockerfile 使用，npm 不会自动读取。保留暂存目录不会让之后的命令自动选择该模块。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:301
msgid ""
"Either way the resolver writes `src/site-ui/active/` and "
"`tsconfig.generated.json`, so the bundler, the type checker and the test "
"runner all read the same decision. Those files are generated; do not edit"
" them."
msgstr ""
"无论采用哪种方式，解析器都会写出 `src/site-ui/active/` 与 "
"`tsconfig.generated.json`，让打包器、类型检查器和测试工具使用同一选择。这些文件由工具生成，请勿手工编辑。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:305
msgid ""
"`npm run type-check` and `next build` both type-check against "
"`tsconfig.generated.json`. It reaches a module's production code through "
"the entries' imports and leaves the module's directory out of its file "
"globs, and the application does not lint a module at all. A module's "
"tests and tooling are for the distribution's own repository to check. A "
"declaration file that nothing imports, such as one holding an ambient "
"`declare module`, is outside that import graph too: reference it from an "
"entry with `/// <reference path=\"./types.d.ts\" />`."
msgstr ""
"`npm run type-check` 和 `next build` 都使用 `tsconfig.generated.json` "
"做类型检查。它通过入口的导入关系覆盖模块的生产代码，并把模块目录排除在文件匹配范围之外；应用也完全不会对模块执行 "
"lint。模块的测试和工具链应由发行版自己的仓库负责检查。没有被任何文件导入的声明文件（例如包含环境声明 `declare module` "
"的文件）同样不在该导入图中：请在入口中用 `/// <reference path=\"./types.d.ts\" />` 引用它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:313
msgid "Assets"
msgstr "资源"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:315
msgid ""
"A module's images live in `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`. The image "
"build packages them in `site-assets/<module-id>/` beside the standalone "
"server rather than in `public/`: Next.js serves `public/` before any "
"route, and a file there would bypass the `/site-assets` route. Three "
"rules, all enforced:"
msgstr ""
"模块图片位于 `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`。镜像构建会把它们打包到独立服务器旁边的 `site-assets"
"/<module-id>/`，而不是 `public/`：Next.js 会在任何路由之前先提供 `public/` "
"中的文件，放在那里的文件会绕过 `/site-assets` 路由。以下三条规则均由工具强制执行："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:320
msgid ""
"**Under the module's own id.** An asset elsewhere fails the build. This "
"is what makes \"two modules cannot write the same path, and neither can "
"shadow the application's\" true."
msgstr "**资源必须位于模块自身 id 下。** 放在其他路径会使构建失败，从而保证不同模块不能写入同一路径，也不能覆盖应用资源。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:323
msgid ""
"**Never a collision.** A module asset at a path the application already "
"ships fails the build rather than overwriting it."
msgstr "**不允许冲突。** 模块资源与应用已有路径冲突时构建失败，不会静默覆盖。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:325
msgid ""
"**The route is what serves them.** `/site-assets/*` serves image files "
"only — AVIF, GIF, ICO, JPEG, PNG, SVG and WebP, up to 20 MB — with a "
"five-minute revalidating cache policy and `nosniff`, and sandboxes an SVG"
" with a `Content-Security-Policy` header. A bundle with anything under "
"`public/site-assets/<module-id>/` fails the build. Test the URL, not the "
"file."
msgstr ""
"**资源由路由提供。** `/site-assets/*` 只提供图片文件（AVIF、GIF、ICO、JPEG、PNG、SVG 和 WebP，最大"
" 20 MB），附带五分钟的重新验证缓存策略和 `nosniff`，并通过 `Content-Security-Policy` 头把 SVG "
"放进沙箱。构建产物的 `public/site-assets/<module-id>/` 下只要有任何内容，构建就会失败。请测试 "
"URL，而不是只看文件是否存在。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:331
msgid ""
"At runtime, `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` is read first and the image's own copy "
"second. A deployment that mounts its branding directory keeps overriding "
"the module's files, and one that mounts nothing still serves a complete "
"site."
msgstr "运行时先读取 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR`，再回退到镜像内的副本。挂载品牌目录的部署可以继续覆盖模块资源；未挂载目录的部署也有完整站点。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:335
msgid ""
"The override works file by file, and `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` must be an "
"absolute path. The build copies a relative symlink as the link it is, "
"with its target unchanged, so a link that stays inside the module keeps "
"working in the image. The route does not serve a link whose target is "
"outside its directory."
msgstr ""
"覆盖按文件逐个生效，且 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` "
"必须是绝对路径。构建会把相对符号链接原样复制为链接，目标保持不变，因此留在模块内部的链接在镜像中仍然有效。目标位于所在目录之外的链接，路由不会提供。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:340
msgid "Styling the shared forms"
msgstr "共享表单样式"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:342
msgid ""
"The shared account forms render their own markup and default styling. "
"Stable semantic hooks provide styles and state; the `fieldLayout` export "
"provides structural variation. The deprecated class map remains supported"
" throughout API v1."
msgstr ""
"共享账号表单负责自己的标记结构和默认样式。稳定的语义属性提供样式与状态接口，`fieldLayout` 导出支持结构差异。已弃用的类名映射在整个 "
"API v1 生命周期内仍受支持。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:347
msgid ""
"**`data-auth` attributes for styling and state.** Shared form elements "
"expose:"
msgstr "**用于样式与状态的 `data-auth` 属性。** 共享表单元素提供："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "On"
msgstr "所在元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"form\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"form\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"the body of an account page: its `<form>`, or the box a result or the "
"sign-up consent step sits in"
msgstr "账号页面的主体：其 `<form>` 元素，或承载结果、注册同意步骤的容器"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"field\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"field\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "each field's wrapper"
msgstr "每个字段的外层元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the label, and each input or textarea"
msgstr "标签，以及每个输入框或文本域"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the hint and the error paragraph"
msgstr "提示与错误段落"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"an info, error or success notice; a button inside one is `[data-"
"auth=\"notice\"] button`"
msgstr "信息、错误或成功提示；提示内的按钮可用 `[data-auth=\"notice\"] button` 选中"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"submit\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"submit\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the page's primary button, or the link that stands in for it"
msgstr "页面的主按钮，或代替主按钮的链接"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"field-action\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"field-action\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the wrapper around a field's own action, such as the forgot-password link"
msgstr "字段自身操作（如忘记密码链接）的外层元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"secondary-actions\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"secondary-actions\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the row of alternative links on `/verify-email`"
msgstr "`/verify-email` 上的备选链接行"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"consent\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"consent\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "each sign-up confirmation: the label holding its checkbox and sentence"
msgstr "每个注册确认项：包含复选框及其说明文字的标签"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"consent-section\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"consent-section\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "each section of the sign-up consent step"
msgstr "注册同意步骤中的每个分区"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the resolving-session region"
msgstr "会话解析中的区域"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:363
msgid ""
"State is carried by the attributes the application already sets — `aria-"
"invalid`, `disabled`, `aria-busy`, `data-auth-error`, `data-auth-tone` — "
"so a stylesheet never has to infer \"this field is in error\" from a "
"class name. The set is part of the contract: an attribute is added, never"
" repurposed."
msgstr ""
"状态由应用设置的现有属性表达，包括 `aria-invalid`、`disabled`、`aria-busy`、`data-auth-error`"
" 和 `data-auth-tone`。样式表无需根据类名猜测字段是否出错。这组属性属于契约：可以新增，但不能改变已有属性的含义。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:368
msgid ""
"The host describes each control itself. Before a `fieldLayout` sees the "
"control, `AuthField` gives it `aria-describedby` naming the field's hint "
"(`<id>-hint`) and error (`<id>-error`), kept alongside any value the page"
" set, and `aria-invalid=\"true\"` while the error shows."
msgstr ""
"控件的描述关联由宿主自己设置。在 `fieldLayout` 拿到控件之前，`AuthField` 会为它设置 `aria-"
"describedby`，指向字段的提示（`<id>-hint`）和错误（`<id>-error`），并保留页面原本设置的值；错误显示期间还会设置"
" `aria-invalid=\"true\"`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:373
msgid ""
"**Field layout.** The optional `fieldLayout` export receives the shared "
"control, hint, error and action nodes, and the label's text and `htmlFor`"
" id. It must render every supplied node, associate the label with that "
"id, and preserve the `data-auth=\"field\"` and `data-auth=\"label\"` "
"hooks. The control arrives already described, so the relationship "
"survives any arrangement that renders every node. The neutral layout "
"places the field action after the control and validation; a module may "
"place it beside its label. `fieldLayout` is a supported export in its own"
" right, not part of the deprecated class map."
msgstr ""
"**字段布局。** 可选的 `fieldLayout` 导出接收共享控件、提示、错误与操作节点，以及标签文本和 `htmlFor` "
"id。它必须渲染所有传入节点，将标签关联到该 id，并保留 `data-auth=\"field\"` 和 `data-"
"auth=\"label\"` "
"属性。控件传入时已经带有描述关联，因此只要每个节点都被渲染，无论如何排列，这种关联都会保留。默认布局将字段操作放在控件与验证信息之后；模块可以将其放在标签旁边。`fieldLayout`"
" 本身就是受支持的独立导出，不属于已弃用的类名映射。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:382
msgid ""
"**Deprecated `authAppearance` class map.** The class-map export stays "
"supported for as long as API v1 does; it holds class names only. New "
"styling should use scoped `data-auth` and state selectors instead. The "
"class map will only be removed in a later API revision, with a migration "
"guide, so existing v1 modules keep working."
msgstr ""
"**已弃用的 `authAppearance` 类名映射**。类名映射导出在 API v1 "
"的整个生命周期内都受支持；它只包含类名。新的样式应改用限定作用域的 `data-auth` 选择器和状态选择器。类名映射只会在之后的某个 API "
"修订版中移除，并会附带迁移指南，因此现有的 v1 模块可以继续正常工作。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:388
msgid ""
"All customization is subject to the same rule: **the module's CSS may "
"only affect the pages it owns.** A stylesheet that reaches `body`, "
"`:root` or a bare element selector will restyle the console too, and no "
"check will catch it for you — scope everything under a root class the "
"module sets on its own shell."
msgstr ""
"所有定制都遵循同一条规则：**模块 CSS 只能影响模块负责的页面。** 选择 `body`、`:root` "
"或裸元素的样式会同时改变控制台，目前没有检查器替你拦截。应将所有规则限定在模块外壳设置的根类名之下。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:393
msgid "When a module component fails"
msgstr "模块组件出错时"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:395
msgid ""
"A module component that throws — `Landing`, `AuthFrame`, `fieldLayout`, "
"`TermsFrame` or `TermsContent` — takes down its own page and nothing "
"else. Each renders inside its page, and the application's route error "
"page (`app/error.tsx`) replaces that page with a neutral message and a "
"Try again button. On a route whose chrome the module draws, the message "
"comes with the console's header and footer. It never falls back to the "
"console's terms or confirmations when the module's fail to render. A "
"console page's own render error is shown the same way, inside the console"
" chrome."
msgstr ""
"抛出异常的模块组件（`Landing`、`AuthFrame`、`fieldLayout`、`TermsFrame` 或 "
"`TermsContent`）只会影响它自己所在的页面。每个组件都在各自页面内渲染，应用的路由错误页（`app/error.tsx`）会用一条中性的提示信息和一个"
" Try again "
"按钮替换该页面。如果该路由的外层框架由模块绘制，提示信息会带上控制台的页头和页脚。模块的条款或确认项渲染失败时，错误页绝不会改用控制台的条款或确认项。控制台页面自身的渲染错误也以同样方式显示在控制台外层框架内。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:404
msgid ""
"React renders no error boundary on the server, so the first response for "
"a failing page is still an error: HTTP 500, or HTTP 200 with a loading "
"state on the account pages that render inside `<Suspense>` (`/login`, "
"`/reset-password` and `/verify-email`). The browser then renders the page"
" again and shows the message. A status code alone does not show that a "
"page works."
msgstr ""
"React 在服务器端不会渲染错误边界，因此出错页面的首次响应仍然是错误：HTTP 500；对于在 `<Suspense>` "
"内渲染的账号页面（`/login`、`/reset-password` 和 `/verify-email`），则是带加载状态的 HTTP "
"200。随后浏览器会重新渲染页面并显示提示信息。仅凭状态码无法证明页面正常。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:410
msgid ""
"A module that fails its load-time check is different: the root layout "
"loads the module, so every page fails with it."
msgstr "未通过加载时检查的模块则不同：根布局会加载模块，因此每个页面都会随之失败。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:413
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:415
msgid ""
"**Adding a module does not change the console.** The five account pages "
"sit in the console container when no `AuthFrame` is exported, and the "
"shared pages, schemas and session handling are untouched either way."
msgstr ""
"**添加模块不会改变控制台。** 未导出 `AuthFrame` "
"时，五个账号页面留在控制台容器中；无论是否提供模块，共享页面、数据结构与会话处理都保持不变。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:418
msgid ""
"**Removing an optional export is safe.** A module that stops exporting "
"`Landing` gets the console's home page back."
msgstr "**移除可选导出是安全的。** 模块停止导出 `Landing` 后，将恢复控制台首页。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:420
msgid ""
"**The legal set is removed whole.** Dropping all three exports brings "
"back the console's terms and confirmations; dropping one of them fails "
"the type check."
msgstr "**法律条款组只能整体移除。** 同时去掉三个导出会恢复控制台的条款和确认项；只去掉其中一个会导致类型检查失败。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:422
msgid ""
"**Renaming or removing an export, changing a prop's meaning, or "
"repurposing a `data-auth` value is a breaking change** and belongs behind"
" an API revision bump. So does renaming a key in `authMessages` or "
"`metaMessages`, or changing its interpolation variables."
msgstr ""
"**重命名或删除导出、改变属性含义，或改变 `data-auth` 值的用途，均属于破坏性变更**，需要提升 API 版本。重命名 "
"`authMessages` 或 `metaMessages` 中的键，或改变其插值变量，也一样。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:426
msgid "**Adding an optional key or attribute is compatible.**"
msgstr "**新增可选键或属性是兼容变更。**"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:428
msgid ""
"`SITE_UI_API` selects the Site UI interface revision. The resolver "
"refuses a module that declares a revision this checkout does not "
"implement, rather than building something neither side was written for."
msgstr ""
"`SITE_UI_API` 用于选择 Site UI "
"接口版本。如果模块声明的版本不是当前源码支持的版本，解析器会拒绝构建，避免产出双方都不支持的组合。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:432
msgid ""
"The module API has no shared public-layout export; a module organizes its"
" own internal layouts freely."
msgstr "模块 API 不提供共享公开布局导出；模块可以自由组织自己的内部布局。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:435
msgid "Testing a module"
msgstr "测试模块"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:437
msgid ""
"The shared repository owns validation and the image recipe. These checks "
"use the built-in neutral module and the public example."
msgstr "共享仓库负责校验和镜像构建配方。这些检查使用内置中立模块和公开示例。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:447
msgid ""
"When checking your own module, pass the same module selection variables "
"used for local development. Exercise normal, invalid, loading and "
"keyboard states of the shared forms, every public page your module "
"supplies, and the console to check for style leakage."
msgstr "检查自己的模块时，传入与本地开发相同的模块选择变量。测试共享表单的正常、无效、加载和键盘操作状态，以及模块提供的每个公开页面，并检查控制台是否受到模块样式影响。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:452
msgid ""
"Then smoke-test the built image: start it with a gateway, since every "
"page reads `/site-config`, and request `/`, the five account pages and "
"`/terms`. `next build` does not load the module, so this is the first "
"point at which its load-time check runs."
msgstr ""
"然后对构建出的镜像做冒烟测试：由于每个页面都会读取 `/site-config`，请连同网关一起启动它，并请求 `/`、五个账号页面和 "
"`/terms`。`next build` 不会加载模块，因此这是模块加载时检查第一次运行的时机。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:457
msgid ""
"From the repository root, build the neutral image and the public example "
"through the same upstream recipe:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录使用同一份上游配方构建默认镜像与公开示例："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:470
msgid ""
"The first manifest must report `kind: \"neutral\"`; the second must "
"report `id: \"example\"`. These image builds need Docker and network "
"access for dependencies. Serving the full application also needs the "
"gateway's runtime `/site-config` endpoint."
msgstr ""
"第一个 manifest 必须报告 `kind: \"neutral\"`，第二个必须报告 `id: \"example\"`。这些构建需要 "
"Docker 以及下载依赖的网络连接。完整应用运行时还需要网关提供 `/site-config` 端点。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:475
msgid ""
"This repository's CI runs the same two builds, and checks how the example"
" image serves its assets, on every change to the console or to the "
"example module. That covers the example only: build and test your "
"distribution's own image and assets as well."
msgstr ""
"控制台或示例模块每次改动时，本仓库的 CI "
"都会跑同样的这两个构建，并检查示例镜像如何提供它的资源。这只覆盖示例：你发行版自己的镜像和资源，也要自行构建和测试。"
